# Vault SOPs

When changing how the agent interprets "workflow" or procedural memory, read [`docs/sops.md`](docs/sops.md).

- **Workflow** in product vocabulary = vault markdown SOP under `ORIGIN/`, executed via normal agent tools/skills.
- **Not** GitHub Actions (`.github/workflows/`), cron-only scheduling without reading the SOP, or removed `run_workflow` / `*.workflow.yaml`.
- SQLite learned workflows remain deprecated; see [`docs/workflow.md`](docs/workflow.md).
